  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling up sustainable settlements for Afghan refugees in the Islamic Republic of Iran</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to scaling up the adoption of sustainable and low-carbon infrastructure in the refugee settlements of Iran to improve refugees# living conditions. The project will implement sustainable technology solutions e.g., installation of renewable energy sources, low-carbon waste and water infrastructures, and facilitate resilient livelihood for refugees through capacity building. The project will strengthen refugees# capacities and access to income generation opportunities through vocational trainings and technology installations with special attention to youth, disabled and women. In addition, the project will assess new settlements and expanding the scope of the project in  urban areas to include host communities where possible..</narrative>
  </description>
